  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-21\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 21</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <div class=\"article-text\">\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>Le présent décret entre en vigueur le dixième jour après sa publication au Moniteur belge, à l'exception des articles:</p>\n                    <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">1° et 3°</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">5</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">7</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">8</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"9\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">9</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"10\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">10</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"12\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">12</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"15\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">15</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"16\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">16</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ol>\n                    <p>qui entrent en vigueur à une date à fixer par le Gouvernement flamand et au plus tard le 1er janvier 2026.</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"paragraph\">\n                <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n                <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n                    <p>Les articles:</p>\n                    <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">2</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6\">\n                            <span class=\"provision-text\">6</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ol>\n                    <p>produisent leurs effets le 1er janvier 2024.</p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>",
